    introduction: 'A repeat order can look straightforward while carrying several different references: an old quotation, a retained sample, a newer product link and revised packaging artwork. Before requesting another batch, bring those references into one record. The aim is to identify exactly what you want repeated and to make any permitted change visible before purchasing decisions are made.',
